134
# Parse failures under `bash scripts/verify-documented-flags.sh` (the default,
# hermetic, --help-probing mode). Down-only.
#
# Measured 2026-08-25 against pmat 3.32.0 over 1037 distinct commands extracted
# from src/*.md. It started that day at 591 and fell as the chapter lanes
# corrected commands; re-measure with `make test-flags-lower` once they settle,
# because slack in a ratchet is room for a regression to hide in.
#
# This is NOT the same number as scripts/documented-commands.baseline. That one
# counts subcommand PATHS that do not resolve; this one counts whole command
# LINES that clap cannot read. `pmat analyze .` is invisible to the first and
# caught by the second.
